ries. Everything from the look and feel of the arcades, to using the latest PC connected to the mind-blowing dial-up connection, all have been recreated with pure love. <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1388870/extras/a02cdc46e57dbef601d900ac4636961e.poster.avif?t=1747925525\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1388870/extras/a02cdc46e57dbef601d900ac4636961e.webm?t=1747925525\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1388870/extras/a02cdc46e57dbef601d900ac4636961e.mp4?t=1747925525\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1388870/extras/fd5f6638050c86c3f0951afedca45957.poster.avif?t=1747925525\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1388870/extras/fd5f6638050c86c3f0951afedca45957.webm?t=1747925525\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1388870/extras/fd5f6638050c86c3f0951afedca45957.mp4?t=1747925525\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Doug Cockle (famous for his voice acting in Victor Vran and The Witcher series) plays the role of Ashley\u2019s berating father. Being too busy in the Riviera to see King Wash for himself, you will receive many phone calls from Gerald sharing his wise words of advice and constant reminders to fix the toilet.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1388870/extras/1b43b5ee15dcf99f9de040299297a6fc.poster.avif?t=1747925525\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/